$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $PQR:$\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 16 & -10 \\\\ 6 & -2 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of $△{P}^{′}{Q}^{′}{R}^{′}$ are ${P}^{′}(0,6),$\n${Q}^{′}(16,-2),$ ${R}^{′}(-10,8).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295203 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c573c068-126f-5e2f-afea-f1531322a7f1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293699}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293699} :answer-field/id #uuid "45291c3d-bf93-5df8-89a0-5e97a758ba6e" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294174} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5486fe08-d2fd-52a3-8eb5-cce00c1a819c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293276}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293276} :answer-field/id #uuid "bd550b10-db56-5ad4-a0e2-3d45dde2fc02" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294602} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "308a3fb1-cf7a-596d-8153-cdf40e4f11b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293134}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293134} :answer-field/id #uuid "c0ba5875-8cd3-551a-8e6b-1f9b40251f0a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :