\,$  $\\,{Y}^{′}($ \n{{field-3}}, \n{{field-4}}\n$),\\,$ $\\,{Z}^{′}($ \n{{field-5}}, \n{{field-6}}\n$)$" :question/worked-solution "To find the image of $△XYZ$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $XYZ:$\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -12 & 4 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of $△{X}^{′}{Y}^{′}{Z}^{′}$ are ${X}^{′}(2,4),$\n${Y}^{′}(-12,-2),$ ${Z}^{′}(4,8).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295204 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f3f4ea68-4635-536c-87d0-8c21de1a867a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293886}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293886} :answer-field/id #uuid "22d7acbc-3757-5994-a1fa-c431a003b46b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294044} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "006aefd8-5818-5b51-a528-fe508c74ecbb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292940}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292940} :answer-field/id #uuid "31b5c101-0661-5f1e-917b-247c475395c1" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294101} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d56c2690-0b8a-5a69-be4c-ee6aca106148" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293760}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :an