dinates of the corresponding vertices of  $△{P}^{′}{Q}^{′}{R}^{′}$, the image of $△PQR$ under the action of $T?$\n\n${P}^{′}($ \n{{field-1}}, \n{{field-2}}\n$),\\,$  $\\,{Q}^{′}($ \n{{field-3}}, \n{{field-4}}\n$),\\,$ $\\,{R}^{′}($ \n{{field-5}}, \n{{field-6}}\n$)$" :question/worked-solution "To find the image of $△PQR$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $PQR:$\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 & -8 \\\\ 2 & 8 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of $△{P}^{′}{Q}^{′}{R}^{′}$ are ${P}^{′}(2,2),$\n${Q}^{′}(18,8),$ ${R}^{′}(-8,-4).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295205 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3df4548d-3f08-56c5-b104-21c1363d97b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293179}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293179} :answer-field/id #uuid "1f0c94f7-b76f-5dac-bb0d-c573f2a1096b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294030} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1862de0-82b7-569c-9abd-cc32914ca5d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293686}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293686} :answer-field/id #uuid "205f48ad-e390-50e5-b68c-80017bd4d8da" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294035} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24d222d7-52c9-