 we first create a matrix $X$ containing the coordinates of the endpoints of $\\overset{―}{EF}:$\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 10 \\\\ 5 & 15\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective endpoints of the image are ${E}^{′}(5,5)$ and ${F}^{′}(10,15).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295201 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "90dcfb73-d94b-5907-ae06-1eafb26dcd6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293496}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293496} :answer-field/id #uuid "2e92ec39-e996-553b-97b1-df9f49646678" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294089} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "43345e03-80ec-568f-a6ae-c099e6082ccd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293206}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293206} :answer-field/id #uuid "329d347d-0d78-53d6-8088-0b51c295a631" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294106} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f31e5e6-cdad-562a-ac45-9011d2a82cb3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293001}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293001} :answer-field/id #uuid "aac25e4c-7d76-5f49-9bb8-8748804e66f1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/bl